  "description": "Bubbly Humble is a delightful playful display font designed to bring joy and sweetness to your creative projects. Crafted by Minimalist Eyes, this charming bubble font features soft, rounded edges and a friendly, whimsical vibe that is perfect for children’s designs, birthday invitations, cute merch, and DIY crafts.\nWhether you are designing custom t-shirts, adorable stickers, school posters, or engaging social media graphics, Bubbly Humble adds a fun and approachable touch to your text. It is fully compatible with Cricut, Silhouette, and other cutting machines, making it a must-have for crafters and designers alike!\nBring joy to your crafts with Bubbly Humble! A cute, playful bubble font perfect for Cricut, stickers, kids’ designs, and DIY projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bubbly Humble is a delightful playful display font designed to bring joy and sweetness to your creative projects. Crafted by Minimalist Eyes, this charming bubble font features soft, rounded edges and a friendly, whimsical vibe that is perfect for children’s designs, birthday invitations, cute merch, and DIY crafts.</p>\n<p>Whether you are designing custom t-shirts, adorable stickers, school posters, or engaging social media graphics, Bubbly Humble adds a fun and approachable touch to your text. It is fully compatible with Cricut, Silhouette, and other cutting machines, making it a must-have for crafters and designers alike!</p>\n<p>Bring joy to your crafts with Bubbly Humble! A cute, playful bubble font perfect for Cricut, stickers, kids’ designs, and DIY projects.</p>",
